    "content": "<section class=\"section\" style=\"padding-top:140px\"><div class=\"container\">\n<h1>İletişim<\/h1>\n<h2>Fuar Standı Ekibimizle Tanışın<\/h2><p class=\"lead\">Bir sonraki fuar standı projenizi konuşalım.<\/p>\n<div class=\"row g-5 mt-3\"><div class=\"col-lg-5\">\n<div class=\"d-flex mb-4\"><div class=\"contact-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-geo-alt-fill\"><\/i><\/div><div><h5>Adres<\/h5><p>Trump Towers No:12 - 405 M.köy Yolu Cd.<br>34358 Şişli İstanbul — Türkiye<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<div class=\"d-flex mb-4\"><div class=\"contact-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-telephone-fill\"><\/i><\/div><div><h5>Telefon<\/h5><p>(+90) 212 876 7001<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<div class=\"d-flex mb-4\"><div class=\"contact-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-envelope-fill\"><\/i><\/div><div><h5>E-posta<\/h5><p>info@mtmessestand.com<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><div class=\"col-lg-7\">\n<form class=\"contact-form\" name=\"contact\" method=\"POST\" data-netlify=\"true\" netlify>\n<div class=\"row g-3\">\n<div class=\"col-md-6\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"Adınız\" required><\/div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6\"><input type=\"email\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"E-posta Adresiniz\" required><\/div>\n<div class=\"col-12\"><textarea class=\"form-control\" rows=\"5\" placeholder=\"Projeniz hakkında bilgi verin...\"><\/textarea><\/div>\n<div class=\"col-12\"><button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\">Mesaj Gönder<\/button><\/div>\n<\/div><\/form><\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/section>",
